"Cloud AI permission" = "云端 AI 授权";
"Cloud AI is allowed" = "已允许使用云端 AI";
"Cloud AI is off" = "云端 AI 已关闭";
"With your permission, questions, selected photos, age, interests and relevant earlier discoveries are sent through our Cloudflare backend to cloud AI services. Answer text is also used to create narration and card illustrations." = "经您同意，问题、选中的照片、年龄、兴趣和相关的历史探索内容，会通过我们的 Cloudflare 后端发送给云端 AI 服务。回答文字也会用于生成语音和卡片插画。";
"Review the service providers and data handling in our privacy policy before allowing cloud AI. Do not include names, addresses, school details or photos of people." = "允许使用前，请阅读隐私政策中的服务提供方及数据处理说明。请勿输入姓名、住址、学校信息或上传人物照片。";
"You can keep using saved cards and prepared discoveries without allowing cloud AI. Turning it off stops new requests. Requests already sent cannot be recalled. Use Delete account and data to remove saved server records." = "不授权也能使用已保存的卡片和预制探索内容。关闭后会停止新请求，已发送的请求无法撤回。如需删除服务器上的记录，请使用“删除账号和数据”。";
"Create family settings above before a grown-up can allow cloud AI." = "请先在上方创建家庭设置，再由家长允许使用云端 AI。";
"Allow cloud AI data use" = "允许云端 AI 使用上述数据";
"Turn off cloud AI" = "关闭云端 AI";
"Cloud AI is off on this device. We will finish the withdrawal on the server when you are online." = "此设备上的云端 AI 已关闭。联网后，我们会继续完成服务器端的撤回操作。";
"Could not update the AI permission. Please try again when online." = "无法更新 AI 授权，请联网后重试。";
"Ask a grown-up to review cloud AI data use. Your question stays on this device until permission is given." = "请家长查看云端 AI 的数据使用说明。获得授权前，问题会保留在此设备上。";
"The AI permission has changed. Please review it again." = "AI 授权状态已变化，请重新查看。";
